{"v":4,"catch":"Video World是一部關於在一個音像店工作的合成流行萬聖節音樂劇，它基於來自合成流行音樂家Monster Mansion的3首原創歌曲。","desc":"為萬聖節裝飾一家影片商店，用神奇的南瓜結交朋友，一邊唱歌和完成節奏的挑戰！\n\n功能：\n· Video World EP的所有3首歌曲，由合成流行歌手Monster Mansion製作\n· 基於節奏的遊戲\n· 喜劇對話\n· 多得嚇人的雙關語\n· 90年代的懷舊\n· 可愛的3D藝術風格","publisher":"Things For Humans","release":"2022-05-26","genres":["音樂","冒險","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/192125d07abf7ec3b752d0b5c95b4d6109e78be8ce96edc9002e980c9710ccca.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ebc8ecc0d74518262a244a80e436fb2586b627cccb3a3bf3816987c96b1604b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6af0ec232898e2362e6b4c5189e7c13b344fac67e345ed84ab4b39cdc2df8f7e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b21e31f5faf992bed44cf1b1e509b291ef7d948e75b5a4557d758372a6717f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cdf68e697d82fa60cfdd6a61aac326a763eb19e7908f2bf4f89adfe9b9a47f9e.jpg"],"titleId":"01001b70144f0000","dlc":[]}